/ffa12152c9882d0953667f26e888d0fbac375f4cc0c348f3710799e1a6e22349.png)\n\nThe {{field-9}} of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/83/83885d091455a8f9b9a1c33556d9deeaee550d50dd665e016c2e8072c926f41a.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186167211 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "7e228f7c-6904-5be1-bb24-073dee51f110" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186167211 #edb/ref 1074 "The general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{aligned}]={c}_{1}{e}^{-2t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+{c}_{2}{e}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}],\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R.\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=2x\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{1}{e}^{-2t}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{-2t}\\to 0$ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{the origin}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/e0/e0446b7851fe0f0612d3db67de05188c0ed63af41ff1dfe2773158b2382fe722.png)\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation \n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}x\n$$\n\nand the straight-line solutions of the form\n${c}_{2}{e}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nlie on that line. \n\nSince ${e}^{t}\\to \\infty $ as $t\\to \\infty ,$ these solutions approach $\\text{infinity}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$\n\nLet's add the solutions to the phase space.\n\n![](images/ff/ffa12152c9882d0953667f26e888d0fbac375f4cc0c348f3710799e1a6e22349.png)\n\nThe $\\text{phase portrait}$ of our system looks as follows:\n\n![](images/83/83885d091455a8f9b9a1c33556d9deeaee550d50dd665e016c2e8072c926f41a.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186167853 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186167854 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186167853 #edb/ref 1061 588231 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186167853 #edb/ref